  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Program to Improve Early Education in Ayacucho, Huancavelica and Hunuco</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Mejoramiento de la Educacin Inicial en Ayacucho, Huancaavelica y Hu</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general del programa es mejorar la calidad de los servicios de educacin inicial para nios de 3 a 5 aos en los departamentos de Ayacucho, Huancavelica y Hunuco</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the operation is to improve the quality of early childhood services for children aged 3-5 years in the departments of Ayacucho, Huanuco, and Huancavelica</narrative>
  </description>
